---
// Standalone Astro page — full HTML below mirrors the approved preview.
// Nav is inline; can be extracted to Base.astro in a follow-up refactor.
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/>
<title>Real events, real people · Denver Social</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&family=Outfit:wght@500;600;700;800;900&family=Caveat:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--bg:#FFFFFF;--surface:#F8F9FB;--border:#E5E7EB;--text:#111827;--text-sec:#6B7280;--text-faint:#9CA3AF;--accent:#7C3AED;--accent2:#3B82F6;--mint:#10B981;--cta-bg:#7C3AED;--cta-text:#FFF;--card-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.06),0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04);--radius:14px;--radius-lg:20px;--space-1:4px;--space-2:8px;--space-3:12px;--space-4:16px;--space-5:24px;--space-6:32px;--space-7:48px;--space-8:64px;--space-9:96px}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}body{font-family:'Inter',system-ui,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text)}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}h1,h2,h3,h4{line-height:1.2}
.site-nav{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100;background:rgba(255,255,255,.88);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(229,231,235,.6)}
.nav-in{max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px;height:64px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}
.brand{font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:18px;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:#7C3AED}
.brand span{color:#9CA3AF;font-weight:400}
.nav-links{display:flex;gap:28px}
.nav-links a{font-size:14px;font-weight:500;color:#374151;transition:color .15s}
.nav-links a:hover,.nav-links a.cur{color:#7C3AED}
.nav-right{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}
.nav-right .nstatus{display:none;font-size:12px;color:#6B7280;font-weight:500;align-items:center;gap:6px}
@media(min-width:920px){.nav-right .nstatus{display:inline-flex}}
.nav-right .nstatus .ndot{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#10B981;box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(16,185,129,.6);animation:dotPulse 2s infinite}
@keyframes dotPulse{0%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(16,185,129,.6)}70%{box-shadow:0 0 0 8px rgba(16,185,129,0)}100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(16,185,129,0)}}
.signin{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#374151}
.signin:hover{color:#7C3AED}
.join{background:#7C3AED;color:#fff;padding:8px 18px;border-radius:999px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;transition:background .15s}
.join:hover{background:#6D28D9}
@media(max-width:760px){.nav-links{display:none}.signin{display:none}}
.hero{position:relative;min-height:72vh;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#1a1b2e 0%,#2d1b4e 50%,#7C3AED 100%);color:#fff;padding:48px 24px}
.hero::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(circle at 20% 30%,rgba(59,130,246,.35),transparent 50%),radial-gradient(circle at 80% 60%,rgba(16,185,129,.3),transparent 55%);pointer-events:none}
.hero svg.peaks{position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;width:100%;height:auto;opacity:.4}
.hero-in{position:relative;max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;width:100%}
.hero-eyebrow{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;font-weight:700;background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);padding:8px 16px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2);margin-bottom:24px}
.pulse{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--mint);box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(16,185,129,.6);animation:pulse 2s infinite}
@keyframes pulse{0%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(16,185,129,.6)}70%{box-shadow:0 0 0 10px rgba(16,185,129,0)}100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(16,185,129,0)}}
.hero h1{font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(48px,9vw,108px);font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin-bottom:16px;line-height:1}
.hero h1 .accent{font-family:'Caveat',cursive;font-weight:600;font-size:.4em;color:#FFD93D;display:block;letter-spacing:0;transform:rotate(-2deg);margin-top:-8px;margin-left:24px}
.hero p.tag{font-size:20px;font-weight:500;max-width:540px;margin-bottom:32px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.85)}
.hero-actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.btn-hero{background:#FFD93D;color:#111;padding:16px 32px;border-radius:50px;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.5px;transition:transform .15s}
.btn-hero:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}.btn-hero:active{transform:translateY(0)}
.btn-hero-out{background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);color:#fff;border:1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);padding:16px 32px;border-radius:50px;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;backdrop-filter:blur(6px)}
.btn-hero-out:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.18)}
.stats{padding:var(--space-9) var(--space-5);background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--surface) 0%,#EEF2FF 50%,#F0FDF4 100%);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.stats::before{content:"";position:absolute;top:-100px;right:-100px;width:400px;height:400px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(124,58,237,.15),transparent 70%);filter:blur(40px)}
.stats-in{max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;text-align:center}
.stats h2{font-family:'Outfit';font-size:clamp(32px,4.5vw,52px);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:var(--space-8);max-width:780px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.stats h2 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--accent);position:relative;display:inline-block}
.stats h2 em::after{content:"";position:absolute;bottom:-4px;left:0;right:0;height:8px;background:#FFD93D;z-index:-1;opacity:.6;border-radius:4px}
.stats-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:var(--space-5)}
.stat{background:#fff;border-radius:24px;padding:var(--space-6) var(--space-6);text-align:left;box-shadow:var(--card-shadow);border:1px solid var(--border);position:relative;overflow:hidden;transition:transform .2s}
.stat:hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}
.stat-label{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text-sec);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:var(--space-2)}
.stat-num{font-family:'Outfit';font-size:80px;font-weight:900;line-height:1;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:6px;letter-spacing:-.03em}
.stat-desc{font-size:15px;color:var(--text-sec);line-height:1.5}
.stat .corner{position:absolute;top:0;right:0;width:80px;height:80px;background:var(--accent);clip-path:polygon(100% 0,0 0,100% 100%);opacity:.08}
.stat:nth-child(2) .corner{background:var(--accent2)}.stat:nth-child(3) .corner{background:var(--mint)}
@media (max-width:880px){.stats-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.stat-num{font-size:64px}}
.lineup{padding:var(--space-9) var(--space-5);background:#0F0F23;color:#fff;text-align:center}
.lineup .section-eyebrow{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:3px;font-weight:800;color:#FFD93D;margin-bottom:var(--space-3)}
.lineup h2{font-family:'Outfit';font-size:clamp(36px,5vw,64px);font-weight:900;margin-bottom:var(--space-7);letter-spacing:-.02em}
.tier{margin-bottom:var(--space-6)}
.tier-label{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:3px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.5);margin-bottom:var(--space-3);font-weight:700}
.tier-1{font-family:'Outfit';font-size:clamp(40px,6vw,72px);font-weight:900;line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.tier-1 a{color:#fff;display:inline-block;margin:0 12px;transition:color .15s}
.tier-1 a:hover{color:#FFD93D}
.tier-2{font-family:'Outfit';font-size:clamp(24px,3.5vw,38px);font-weight:800;line-height:1.2;color:rgba(255,255,255,.9)}
.tier-2 a{color:inherit;display:inline-block;margin:0 10px}.tier-2 a:hover{color:#FFD93D}
.tier-3{font-size:17px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,.75);max-width:880px;margin:0 auto}
.tier-3 a{color:inherit;display:inline-block;margin:0 8px}.tier-3 a:hover{color:#FFD93D}
.dot{opacity:.4}.divider{width:60px;height:2px;background:#FFD93D;margin:var(--space-5) auto}
.lineup-cta{margin-top:var(--space-7)}
.btn-yellow{background:#FFD93D;color:#111;padding:16px 32px;border-radius:50px;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;display:inline-block;transition:transform .15s}
.btn-yellow:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}
.programme{padding:var(--space-9) var(--space-5);background:#fff}.programme-in{max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto}
.programme h2{font-family:'Outfit';font-size:clamp(32px,4.5vw,52px);font-weight:800;text-align:center;margin-bottom:var(--space-3);letter-spacing:-.02em}
.programme .sub{text-align:center;color:var(--text-sec);font-size:18px;margin-bottom:var(--space-7);max-width:600px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}
.prog-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(12,1fr);gap:var(--space-4)}
.prog-card{position:relative;border-radius:24px;overflow:hidden;min-height:280px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;padding:var(--space-6);color:#fff;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .25s}
.prog-card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}
.prog-card .meta{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;font-weight:700;opacity:.85;margin-bottom:6px;text-transform:uppercase}
.prog-card h3{font-family:'Outfit';font-size:28px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:var(--space-2);line-height:1.1;color:#fff}
.prog-card p{font-size:14px;opacity:.9;line-height:1.5}
.prog-card .emoji-bg{position:absolute;top:20px;right:20px;font-size:64px;opacity:.4}
.pc-1{grid-column:span 7;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#FF6B9D,#C026D3,#7C3AED);min-height:340px}
.pc-2{grid-column:span 5;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#10B981,#0D9488)}
.pc-3{grid-column:span 4;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#F59E0B,#EF4444)}
.pc-4{grid-column:span 4;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3B82F6,#1E40AF)}
.pc-5{grid-column:span 4;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0F172A,#475569)}
.pc-6{grid-column:span 12;min-height:200px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#FBBF24,#D97706);display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;align-items:center;padding:32px 40px}
.pc-6 h3{font-size:36px;margin-bottom:4px;color:#111}.pc-6 .meta{color:#111}.pc-6 p{color:#111;opacity:.8}
.pc-6 .btn-yellow{background:#111;color:#FFD93D;justify-self:end}
@media (max-width:880px){.prog-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.prog-card{grid-column:span 1!important}.pc-6{grid-template-columns:1fr}.pc-6 .btn-yellow{justify-self:start;margin-top:var(--space-4)}}
.pillars{padding:var(--space-9) var(--space-5);background:var(--surface)}.pillars-in{max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto}
.section-eyebrow{display:block;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:3px;font-weight:800;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:var(--space-3)}
.section-eyebrow.center{text-align:center}
.section-h2{font-family:'Outfit';text-align:center;font-size:clamp(34px,4.5vw,52px);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:var(--space-4);max-width:760px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.section-sub{text-align:center;color:var(--text-sec);font-size:18px;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto var(--space-8)}
.pillar-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:var(--space-5)}
.pillar{background:#fff;border-radius:24px;padding:var(--space-6);position:relative;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--border);transition:transform .2s}
.pillar:hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}
.pillar-num{font-family:'Outfit';font-size:96px;font-weight:900;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.05em;color:var(--accent);opacity:.15;position:absolute;top:8px;right:20px}
.pillar h3{font-family:'Outfit';font-size:24px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:var(--space-3);position:relative}
.pillar p{font-size:15px;color:var(--text-sec);line-height:1.6;position:relative}
.pillar .pillar-illus{font-size:32px;margin-bottom:var(--space-5);width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:14px;background:var(--surface);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
@media (max-width:880px){.pillar-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.host-strip{padding:var(--space-9) var(--space-5);background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}
.host-in{max-width:780px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center}
.host-in h2{font-family:'Outfit';font-size:clamp(28px,3.5vw,40px);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:var(--space-4)}
.host-in p{color:var(--text-sec);font-size:17px;margin-bottom:var(--space-5);max-width:600px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}
.checks{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0 auto var(--space-6);max-width:480px;text-align:left}
.checks li{padding:var(--space-2) 0;font-size:15px}
.btn-cta{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:50px;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;display:inline-block;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(124,58,237,.3);transition:transform .15s}
.btn-cta:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}
.cta-final{padding:var(--space-9) var(--space-5);background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent2));color:#fff;text-align:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.cta-final::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%,rgba(255,217,61,.2),transparent 50%);pointer-events:none}
.cta-final h2{font-family:'Outfit';font-size:clamp(36px,5vw,64px);font-weight:900;margin-bottom:var(--space-4);position:relative;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.cta-final p{font-size:18px;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto var(--space-6);opacity:.9;position:relative}
.cta-final-actions{position:relative;display:inline-flex;gap:var(--space-3);flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center}
.btn-clear{background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);color:#fff;border:1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);padding:16px 32px;border-radius:50px;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;backdrop-filter:blur(6px);display:inline-block}
.btn-clear:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.18)}
@media (max-width:680px){.hero{min-height:64vh;padding:32px 16px}.stats,.lineup,.programme,.pillars,.host-strip,.cta-final{padding-left:16px;padding-right:16px}}
</style></head><body>

<header class="site-nav"><div class="nav-in">
  <a href="/" class="brand">denver<span>social</span>hub</a>
  <nav class="nav-links">
    <a href="/events">Events</a>
    <a href="/potlucks">Potlucks</a>
    <a href="/community">Community</a>
    <a href="/about">About</a>
    <a href="/host">Host</a>
  </nav>
  <div class="nav-right">
    <span class="nstatus"><span class="ndot"></span>Denver, CO</span>
    <a href="/sign-in" class="signin">Sign in</a>
    <a href="/signup" class="join">Join us</a>
  </div>
</div></header>

<section class="hero">
  <svg class="peaks" viewBox="0 0 1440 200" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
    <path d="M0,200 L0,140 L160,60 L320,120 L480,40 L640,100 L800,30 L960,90 L1120,50 L1280,110 L1440,70 L1440,200 Z" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.08)"/>
    <path d="M0,200 L0,170 L120,100 L280,140 L440,80 L600,130 L760,70 L920,120 L1080,90 L1240,140 L1440,110 L1440,200 Z" fill="rgba(0,0,0,0.2)"/>
  </svg>
  <div class="hero-in">
    <span class="hero-eyebrow"><span class="pulse"></span>DENVER · COMMUNITY · SINCE 2026</span>
    <h1>Show up.<span class="accent">— that's the whole pitch.</span></h1>
    <p class="tag">Real small-group events across the city. Hikes, dinners, plunges, potlucks at Cheesman, something every week. RSVP with an email and go.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="#" class="btn-hero">Browse events →</a>
      <a href="#" class="btn-hero-out">Jump to potlucks</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="stats"><div class="stats-in">
  <h2>This is Denver, <em>actually getting together</em>.</h2>
  <div class="stats-grid">
    <div class="stat"><div class="corner"></div><div class="stat-label">Neighbors</div><div class="stat-num">80+</div><div class="stat-desc">locals on the platform — what started as a table for 8 in RiNo</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><div class="corner"></div><div class="stat-label">Coming up</div><div class="stat-num">12</div><div class="stat-desc">events on the calendar — potlucks at Cheesman, dinners at Hop Alley, hikes, plunges</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><div class="corner"></div><div class="stat-label">Across</div><div class="stat-num">18</div><div class="stat-desc">Denver neighborhoods covered, from LoHi to Hampden, RiNo to Wash Park</div></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="lineup">
  <div class="section-eyebrow">DENVER SOCIAL PRESENTS</div>
  <h2>The Lineup</h2>
  <div class="tier"><div class="tier-label">— HEADLINERS</div>
    <div class="tier-1"><a href="/potlucks">Summer Kickoff Potluck</a><span class="dot"> · </span><a href="/events">Table for 8 · Tuesday Dinner</a></div>
  </div>
  <div class="divider"></div>
  <div class="tier"><div class="tier-label">— THIS WEEK</div>
    <div class="tier-2">
      <a href="#">Cheesman Sunset Picnic</a><span class="dot"> · </span>
      <a href="#">Red Rocks Sunrise Hike</a><span class="dot"> · </span>
      <a href="#">Sloan's Lake Cold Plunge</a><span class="dot"> · </span>
      <a href="#">RiNo First Friday Walk</a><span class="dot"> · </span>
      <a href="#">Cap Hill Stoop Coffee</a><span class="dot"> · </span>
      <a href="#">Pottery Wheel Night</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="divider"></div>
  <div class="tier"><div class="tier-label">— ALSO ON THE CALENDAR</div>
    <div class="tier-3">
      <a href="#">Wash Park Volleyball</a><span class="dot"> · </span>
      <a href="#">Highlands Brunch Crew</a><span class="dot"> · </span>
      <a href="#">Friday Run Club at Wash Park</a><span class="dot"> · </span>
      <a href="#">City Park Frisbee Sunday</a><span class="dot"> · </span>
      <a href="#">Berkeley Lake Walk</a><span class="dot"> · </span>
      <a href="#">Five Points Salsa Night</a><span class="dot"> · </span>
      <a href="#">LoHi Pizza Crawl</a><span class="dot"> · </span>
      <a href="#">Bowling at Lucky Strike</a><span class="dot"> · </span>
      <a href="#">Game Night · Capitol Hill</a><span class="dot"> · </span>
      <a href="#">Sunday Brunch · Snooze</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="lineup-cta"><a href="#" class="btn-yellow">See the full calendar →</a></div>
</section>

<section class="programme"><div class="programme-in">
  <h2>What we get up to</h2><p class="sub">Five tracks running all summer. Pick one, pick all five.</p>
  <div class="prog-grid">
    <div class="prog-card pc-1"><span class="emoji-bg">🥾</span><div class="meta">FRIDAYS · ALL SUMMER</div><h3>Sunset Hikes</h3><p>Twelve trails, twelve Fridays, golden hour every time.</p></div>
    <div class="prog-card pc-2"><span class="emoji-bg">🍽</span><div class="meta">EVERY OTHER SUNDAY</div><h3>The Big Potluck</h3><p>Cheesman Park. Bring a dish, find your people.</p></div>
    <div class="prog-card pc-3"><span class="emoji-bg">🏺</span><div class="meta">SATURDAYS</div><h3>Pottery &amp; Making</h3><p>Studio drop-ins, all levels.</p></div>
    <div class="prog-card pc-4"><span class="emoji-bg">🎲</span><div class="meta">WEEKNIGHTS</div><h3>Game Nights</h3><p>Rotating hosts, rotating bars.</p></div>
    <div class="prog-card pc-5"><span class="emoji-bg">🧊</span><div class="meta">SUNRISE</div><h3>Cold Plunges</h3><p>Sloan's Lake. Yes, even in July.</p></div>
    <a href="#" class="prog-card pc-6">
      <div><div class="meta">YOUR EVENT, OUR CALENDAR</div><h3>Got something to host?</h3><p>Free to list. Live in two minutes.</p></div>
      <span class="btn-yellow inline">Add it →</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="pillars"><div class="pillars-in">
  <span class="section-eyebrow center">— WHY THIS WORKS</span>
  <h2 class="section-h2">Three things we don't do.</h2>
  <p class="section-sub">The whole platform is shaped around what we left out.</p>
  <div class="pillar-grid">
    <div class="pillar"><span class="pillar-num">01</span><div class="pillar-illus">🚫</div><h3>No algorithm</h3><p>Events show up in the order they happen. Nothing is "boosted." The thing on top is the thing happening soonest.</p></div>
    <div class="pillar"><span class="pillar-num">02</span><div class="pillar-illus">💸</div><h3>No paid tier</h3><p>Hosting is free. Listing is free. RSVPing is free. No premium tier locked behind something that should be public.</p></div>
    <div class="pillar"><span class="pillar-num">03</span><div class="pillar-illus">📭</div><h3>No spam DMs</h3><p>You can't message another member without a mutual RSVP. The platform stays out of the way of the actual meeting.</p></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="host-strip"><div class="host-in">
